# Step 44 (ancient populations, opt-in; `setup.sh --ancient-panel`): the
# Allen Ancient DNA Resource (AADR, Mallick et al. 2024, Sci Data 11:182),
# Harvard Dataverse doi:10.7910/DVN/FFIDCW, CC0. Its 1240K files of this
# release by their Dataverse file id, each checked against the md5 Dataverse
# publishes for it (the .geno is 7.1 GB, deleted once the panel is built).
# UCSC's hg19ToHg38 chain moves the sites to GRCh38, checked against its
# sha256. Change the release, the four ids and the four md5s together.
AADR_VERSION="v66.p1"
AADR_ANNO_ID="13994515"
AADR_ANNO_MD5="a2db1ac16f0f3558ed66fb251e1d5c7d"
