# The recurrent CNV regions of the interval rows of bin/cn_loci.tsv (step 35):
# ClinGen Dosage Sensitivity's recurrent CNV BED, version 2.1, GRCh38 (CC0),
# checked against the sha256 of the file as downloaded on 2026-11-04.
# scripts/ci/build-cn-intervals.py turns it into the rows; the e2e case
# tests/e2e/cn-intervals-1-catalog.sh rebuilds them and fails on any
# difference. Change the two together, then rerun the script.
CLINGEN_RECURRENT_CNV_URL="https://ftp.clinicalgenome.org/ClinGen_recurrent_CNV_V2.1-hg38.bed"
